---
---
<section class="founder-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-inner">

      <div class="founder-photo-wrap">
        <img
          src="/poza_vali.jpeg"
          alt="Valentin Avram — Fondator Hello Web"
          class="founder-photo"
          width="160"
          height="160"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="founder-quote-wrap">
        <div class="founder-quote-mark">"</div>
        <p class="founder-quote">
          Un vizitator care nu primește răspuns în 5 minute caută în altă parte.
          MyChatbot există pentru că am văzut prea mulți proprietari de business
          pierzând clienți din cauza unui mesaj fără răspuns.
        </p>
        <div class="founder-identity">
          <div class="founder-line"></div>
          <div>
            <p class="founder-name">Valentin Avram</p>
            <p class="founder-title">Fondator Hello Web · MyChatbot</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.founder-section {
  background: #f0f9ff;
  border-top: 1px solid #e0f2fe;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e0f2fe;
  padding: 3rem 0;
}
.founder-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.founder-photo-wrap {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.founder-photo {
  width: 160px;
  height: 160px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: top;
  border: 3px solid #2563eb;
  display: block;
}
.founder-quote-wrap {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 280px;
}
.founder-quote-mark {
  font-size: 72px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: #2563eb;
  opacity: 0.3;
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  margin-bottom: -12px;
}
.founder-quote {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #1e3a5f;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
}
.founder-identity {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.founder-line {
  width: 36px;
  height: 2px;
  background: #2563eb;
  border-radius: 2px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.founder-name {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #0f172a;
}
.founder-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #64748b;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .founder-inner {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .founder-identity {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .founder-quote-mark {
    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
